      <title>Moderna与默沙东癌症疫苗晚期试验显效，黑色素瘤复发风险降低</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260819/Moderna%E4%B8%8E%E9%BB%98%E6%B2%99%E4%B8%9C%E7%99%8C%E7%97%87%E7%96%AB%E8%8B%97%E6%99%9A%E6%9C%9F%E8%AF%95%E9%AA%8C%E6%98%BE%E6%95%88%E9%BB%91%E8%89%B2%E7%B4%A0%E7%98%A4%E5%A4%8D%E5%8F%91%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E/</link>
